{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52912","headline":"地藏菩萨赞 · 李白","name":"地藏菩萨赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本心若虚空，清净无一物。\n焚荡淫怒痴，圆寂了见佛。\n五彩图圣像，悟真非妄传。\n扫雪万病尽，爽然清凉天。\n赞此功德海，永爲旷代宣。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}